{
  "name": "dsh-chat-flow",
  "version": "0.8.5",
  "description": "DSH 对话流增强插件（自 dsh-webui 拆出，零 DSH 源码改动、纯插件注入）。回合呈现：思考 chip（实时时长 + 实时文字滚动）+ 工具调用聚合 chip + 对话流卡片（步骤卡/总结卡，回合结束后才出现）+ 共享活动抽屉（思考语义分组 + 工具调用树）。正文增强：proto-tabs 可交互卡片（pill/expand/glow）+ diagram 流程图围栏（JSON 转 SVG）+ 本地 HTML 内嵌预览（识别正文里的 .html/.htm 路径，host 读文件并注入 base 使同目录资源生效，iframe 沙箱隔离，高度自适应，1:1 与等比缩放，浏览器打开）。界面与工具：会话头部对话/轨迹标签上移到右上角 + 对话截图（常驻无头浏览器渲染 markdown/shiki/mermaid 真图，可内嵌本地 HTML）+ download 下载工具（host 注册 wire 工具与进度路由，client keyed toolview 实时进度条/速度/ETA）。", 
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "reasoning",
    "tool-summary",
    "activity-drawer",
    "flow-card",
    "screenshot",
    "download",
    "progress",
    "proto-tabs",
    "diagram",
    "html-preview",
    "iframe",
    "chat-flow"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/statem-li/dsh-chat-flow.git"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "scripts",
    "build.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool"
      ]
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke-client.mjs && node scripts/smoke-host.mjs",
    "smoke:client": "node scripts/smoke-client.mjs",
    "smoke:host": "node scripts/smoke-host.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "dependencies": {
    "markdown-it": "^15.0.1",
    "markdown-it-emoji": "^3.1.0",
    "markdown-it-task-lists": "^2.1.1",
    "shiki": "^4.4.3"
  }
}
